  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 0,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.333,
            0.171,
            0.692,
            0.199
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第十二章 其他技术"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.219,
            0.907,
            0.325
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "随着现代生物学的发展，越来越多的先进设备及手段用于细胞生物学的研究。其中包括流式细胞技术、免疫荧光技术、细胞凋亡检测技术等，这些检测技术以及设备正日益在细胞学实验中得以普及，具有高效、高精度等优点，与传统细胞学实验方法一起，成为细胞实验学不可或缺的组成部分。本章就这些技术作一个概要的介绍，包括细胞放射自显影、流式细胞技术、荧光标记、激光共聚焦技术、显微注射和凋亡检测。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.338,
            0.363,
            0.69,
            0.386
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "实验 66 细胞放射自显影"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.394,
            0.27,
            0.417
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验目的】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.429,
            0.71,
            0.447
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "学习同位素标记培养细胞的方法；学习掌握放射自显影技术。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.458,
            0.27,
            0.48
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验原理】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.493,
            0.908,
            0.576
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "在细胞培养液中掺入  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "[^{3}H]"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " -胸腺嘧啶核苷，可以正确标记细胞核。同位素标记分为瞬间标记和连续标记。瞬间标记为半小时至几小时，可使处于 S 期的细胞核获得标记。连续标记是使同位素与细胞接触约 24h（一个细胞周期），此时可使所有细胞核被  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "[^{3}H]"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  所标记。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.58,
            0.906,
            0.619
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞放射自显影用于研究细胞周期、细胞动力学和细胞的生物学特性比较等方面，如细胞增殖与分化异常、辐射对细胞的损伤与修复、DNA 和蛋白质合成等。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.622,
            0.906,
            0.663
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "同位素的用量为 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1.85 \\times 10^{4} \\sim 1.48 \\times 10^{5} \\mathrm{~Bq/ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "，以尽可能低而又能充分标记为佳。本实验中采用 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1.85 \\times 10^{4} \\mathrm{~Bq/ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 培养液进行标记。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.673,
            0.432,
            0.696
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验仪器、材料和试剂】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.708,
            0.906,
            0.75
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 仪器、用具: 冰箱、"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{CO}_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 培养箱、恒温水浴、电热搅拌恒温水浴、切片匣、搪瓷盘、乳胶小杯、恒温恒湿操作箱、切片干燥架、暗匣、培养皿、盖玻片。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.752,
            0.548,
            0.77
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 材料:无支原体污染的培养细胞一瓶。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.773,
            0.255,
            0.79
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 试剂"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.795,
            0.294,
            0.812
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1）核Ⅳ乳胶。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.816,
            0.325,
            0.833
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2）D19B 显影液。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.838,
            0.354,
            0.855
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3）酸性坚膜定影液。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.859,
            0.429,
            0.876
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4）核固红或 Giemsa 染色液。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.88,
            0.842,
            0.899
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5） "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "[^{3}H]"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " -胸腺嘧啶核苷、细胞培养液、Hank液、胰蛋白酶/EDTA消化液。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 1,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.407,
            0.056,
            0.593,
            0.073
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第十二章 其他技术"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.826,
            0.057,
            0.861,
            0.072
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "209"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.092,
            0.327,
            0.111
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6）Carnoy固定液。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.114,
            0.241,
            0.133
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7) 乙醇。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.135,
            0.302,
            0.155
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8）加拿大树胶。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.108,
            0.165,
            0.286,
            0.188
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【方法与步骤】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.108,
            0.198,
            0.895,
            0.24
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 培养细胞按常规法用胰蛋白酶/EDTA消化液进行消化, 用少量培养液分散细胞制成细胞悬液。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.242,
            0.672,
            0.26
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 在放有 4 片盖玻片的平皿中加入 5～6ml 完全培养液。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.262,
            0.895,
            0.303
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（3）细胞悬液接种于平皿，使细胞分散均匀，每皿细胞数为 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5 \\times 10^{4} \\sim 6 \\times 10^{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 个，置于 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{CO}_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 培养箱中培养 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4 \\sim 6\\mathrm{h}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.305,
            0.897,
            0.389
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（4）吸去培养液，加入含  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "[^{3}H]"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " -胸腺嘧啶核苷的 Hank 液（ "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "[^{3}H]"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " -TdR 含量为  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1.85 \\times 10^{4} Bq/ml"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ），标记培养 0.5～1h 后，小心吸出标记培养液，用 Hank 液反复漂洗细胞表面和平皿 3～5 次。加入完全培养液培养 30～48h，当细胞增殖到 2/3 满层时取出，吸去培养液，加入 4～5ml 固定液固定 20min。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.391,
            0.898,
            0.474
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（5）去固定液，先后用75%乙醇、50%乙醇、30%乙醇和蒸馏水依次洗脱，每次10min，最后用三蒸水漂洗后，取出长有细胞的盖玻片垂直于吸水纸上吸去多余的水分，自然干燥后用加拿大树胶封固于洁净的载玻片上（注意，一定要使生长细胞的面朝上），自然干燥。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.477,
            0.317,
            0.495
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "以下为暗室操作:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.497,
            0.899,
            0.559
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(6) 从冰箱取出核IV乳胶, 取 2 或 3 匙至乳胶小杯中。调节 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "40^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的水浴, 使循环装置与乳胶杯两端接通, 水流不断通过乳胶杯外层形成一恒温水浴, 用玻璃棒不停搅拌杯中乳胶使其融化。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.562,
            0.899,
            0.624
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(7) 液化的乳胶用浸沾法或滴涂法使乳胶均匀涂布于载玻片表面。将玻片垂直于吸水纸上吸去多余的乳胶后插入暗箱晾干, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 \\sim 3 \\mathrm{~h}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 后取出放入切片匣, 外用两层黑纸包封, 套上塑料袋于 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 冰箱曝光 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 \\sim 3"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 天 (曝光所需时间与使用的同位素剂量有关)。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.626,
            0.898,
            0.666
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(8) 取出标本先后在 D19B 显影液中显影，在酸性坚膜定影液中定影，显影温度为 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "(19 \\pm 1)^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "，显影 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 \\mathrm{~min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "，定影 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "15 \\mathrm{~min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "。定影后清水冲洗，三蒸水漂净，自然风干。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.668,
            0.47,
            0.687
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(9) 核固红或 Giemsa 染色 15min。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.69,
            0.9,
            0.73
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（10）镜检。先在低倍镜下找到细胞群，再用高倍镜观察标记细胞核，计数100个细胞中被标记的细胞核。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.74,
            0.264,
            0.764
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【注意事项】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.775,
            0.684,
            0.795
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "实验中对同位素的使用，应严格遵守放射性核素使用规则。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.805,
            0.21,
            0.829
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【作业】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.839,
            0.745,
            0.859
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "对观察的结果进行比较分析，计数100个细胞中被标记的细胞核。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.812,
            0.882,
            0.898,
            0.899
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(刘兵)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
